      "subject": "FNOL: Coastal Property Management LLC | Policy CPP-2214569 | Retail center water damage",
      "body": "Good morning,\n\nPlease accept this first notice of loss for Coastal Property Management LLC under policy CPP-2214569 with Nationwide Mutual Insurance Company.\n\nReported incident: water intrusion and resulting damage at a managed retail center location following a roof leak discovered this morning. The insured is requesting a claim be opened immediately and that an adjuster be assigned as soon as possible.\n\nLoss details provided by Hector Ramos:\n- Insured: Coastal Property Management LLC\n- Policy No.: CPP-2214569\n- Contact: Hector Ramos, (813) 555-0177, hramos@coastalpm.com\n\nPlease confirm claim number, assigned adjuster, and any next steps for documentation. If you need any additional information, please let us know.\n\nThank you,\nMaya Collins\nGulf Coast Insurance Group\n\nSent from my iPhone",
      "sender": "Maya Collins's Assistant <assistant@nationwide.com> on behalf of Maya Collins <submissions@gulfcoastig.com>",
